WEBVTT

00:12.520 --> 00:13.930
It's so cold!

00:13.930 --> 00:16.480
I'll want the kotatsu soon!

00:16.480 --> 00:20.330
We won't make it through 
the winter with this little heater!

00:20.860 --> 00:23.830
Hey, Yukichi. Where's our kotatsu?

00:27.020 --> 00:27.790
Huh?

00:28.230 --> 00:28.940
Huh?!

00:28.940 --> 00:30.360
We have a kotatsu, right?!

00:31.840 --> 00:33.390
You threw it away?!

00:33.390 --> 00:35.130
Why?! That's terrible!

00:38.030 --> 00:39.310
<i>One year ago...</i>

01:00.450 --> 01:03.420
Oh, I forgot about that...

01:20.810 --> 01:27.940
<b>The Masterful Cat
Is Depressed Again Today</b>

02:35.000 --> 02:38.670
Can

02:35.000 --> 02:38.670
<b>A Masterful Cat Is Photogenic</b>

02:38.800 --> 02:40.010
<b>A Masterful Cat Is Photogenic</b>

02:38.880 --> 02:40.010
Can

02:55.230 --> 02:57.240
U-Um!

02:58.110 --> 03:03.120
Why don't we buy a new 
kotatsu with my bonus?

03:03.630 --> 03:07.580
I have sincerely reflected 
upon my past mistakes!

03:08.340 --> 03:10.420
I won't make it my nest!

03:10.420 --> 03:12.120
I won't eat or drink near it!

03:12.500 --> 03:14.420
I also won't forget to turn it off!

03:14.850 --> 03:16.680
So, please!

03:29.620 --> 03:31.690
It makes me sad that you don't trust me!

03:32.050 --> 03:34.020
Just imagine!

03:34.430 --> 03:38.530
A kotatsu is a must for someone 
who hates air conditioners like you, Yukichi!

03:38.530 --> 03:43.540
It'll gently warm your toe beans after they 
freeze from doing housework or going out.

03:44.410 --> 03:46.280
A small oasis.

03:46.280 --> 03:48.210
Just imagine!

03:54.040 --> 03:59.550
<b>It'll gently warm frozen toe beans...</b>

03:54.590 --> 03:58.310
<i>It'll gently warm frozen toe beans...</i>

03:58.500 --> 03:59.550
<b>Gwah!!</b>

04:09.520 --> 04:12.520
<b>Scrub
Scrub</b>

04:10.910 --> 04:12.110
Why?!

04:13.240 --> 04:16.220
<i>Please stand behind the yellow line.</i>

04:18.980 --> 04:22.530
<i>I should just go ahead and buy one!</i>

04:23.190 --> 04:25.790
<i>He won't toss it out since he's so stingy.</i>

04:25.790 --> 04:28.050
<i>Ko-ta-tsu...</i>

04:28.620 --> 04:30.440
<i>Buy now on Amazun...</i>

04:30.440 --> 04:31.080
Wha?!

04:33.290 --> 04:35.540
H-Hey, hey, hey! Where are
 you taking my phone?!

04:37.850 --> 04:38.730
No!

04:38.730 --> 04:41.340
You're too resolute about this!

04:45.670 --> 04:46.840
<i>Rescued.</i>

04:49.270 --> 04:50.730
<i>That was scary...</i>

04:51.060 --> 04:52.850
<i>Begging didn't work.</i>

04:53.240 --> 04:55.520
<i>I couldn't force my way through, either!</i>

04:55.520 --> 04:57.230
<i>If that's the case...</i>

04:59.070 --> 05:00.940
<i>I'll have to bribe him.</i>

05:01.810 --> 05:04.810
<i>Churu! Nyan Petit! Silver vine! Catnip!</i>

05:04.810 --> 05:06.380
<i>I'll buy it all!</i>

05:08.220 --> 05:10.920
Yukichi! I'll do the grocery 
shopping today...

05:10.920 --> 05:12.950
Wait, he already left?!

05:12.950 --> 05:15.210
He's too freaking capable!

05:18.380 --> 05:21.510
Let's have curry tonight! 
Mama, doesn't it sound good?

05:21.510 --> 05:24.130
Buy it! Buy it!

05:22.950 --> 05:24.130
No!

05:25.420 --> 05:27.180
Don't wander around!

05:27.180 --> 05:28.140
Okay.

05:30.610 --> 05:32.680
Don't run around.

05:45.160 --> 05:47.190
Do you have a point card?

05:58.750 --> 06:01.500
<b>Nishina</b>

05:58.750 --> 06:01.500
<b>Prize</b>

05:58.750 --> 06:01.500
<b>Prize</b>

05:58.750 --> 06:02.940
This way for the lottery drawing.

06:03.750 --> 06:08.930
<b>Prize</b>

06:03.750 --> 06:08.930
<b>Prize</b>

06:03.750 --> 06:08.930
<b>Prize</b>

06:03.750 --> 06:08.930
You can spin the lottery machine 
for every five eligible receipts.

06:09.350 --> 06:12.300
<i>Prize C, a personal kotatsu with futon.</i>

06:12.960 --> 06:14.600
You have two spins.

06:14.600 --> 06:15.160
Thanks.

06:19.270 --> 06:24.270
<b>Receipts</b>

06:29.950 --> 06:33.130
Here's your participation reward,
 pocket tissues.

07:15.710 --> 07:18.330
A life without a kotatsu...

07:18.710 --> 07:20.500
What's the point of living?

07:29.940 --> 07:31.510
I'm home!

07:31.890 --> 07:33.970
Ouch!

07:34.640 --> 07:37.310
Don't open the door so suddenly!

07:39.300 --> 07:43.460
Hey! What's wrong, Yukichi?!

07:46.730 --> 07:49.230
2 Piece Set (Table • Futon)
<b>Personal Kotatsu</b>

07:46.730 --> 07:49.230
<b>Prize</b>

07:49.810 --> 07:51.400
I-It's not what you're thinking!

07:51.400 --> 07:53.010
I didn't buy it!

07:53.560 --> 07:56.240
I won it from the lottery 
at the supermarket!

07:56.240 --> 07:58.740
I borrowed their cart.

07:56.240 --> 08:00.160
<b>Prize</b>

08:00.160 --> 08:07.130
An old lady gave me her extra receipts 
when I went out to buy your favorites.

08:07.130 --> 08:08.200
Four receipts!

08:09.270 --> 08:12.980
So, I gave it a try, and I got the prize!

08:17.940 --> 08:20.120
Installation complete!

08:20.980 --> 08:23.630
Now, now, now! Come join me, Yukichi-sama!

08:23.630 --> 08:27.140
I even borrowed an UMYU-Sea 
live concert DVD!

08:28.140 --> 08:30.250
<i>Cat food only.</i>

08:31.100 --> 08:33.900
Well? Well? Isn't it nice?!

08:33.900 --> 08:36.000
What do you want to eat first?

08:39.550 --> 08:41.940
Don't worry about me!

08:41.940 --> 08:44.710
I'm super happy just sitting in a kotatsu.

08:45.280 --> 08:48.520
You can sleep if you feel sleepy!

08:48.520 --> 08:50.800
I'll clean everything up!

08:54.510 --> 08:55.420
Huh?

09:03.680 --> 09:05.420
Huh?!

09:06.320 --> 09:08.190
No! No! I'm fine!

09:08.550 --> 09:11.340
Huh? I-Is it really okay?

09:11.660 --> 09:13.400
Can I really drink it?!

09:15.580 --> 09:20.540
<i>Yukichi bought a baby guard 
tabletop cover the next day.</i>

09:18.490 --> 09:21.910
Safety guard for babies

09:28.960 --> 09:35.970
Purr

09:30.950 --> 09:32.930
<i>He nodded off!</i>

09:44.400 --> 09:46.350
Hey, Yukichi.

09:48.670 --> 09:52.230
Yukki! Yukki-chan!

09:52.760 --> 09:54.740
Hey...

09:55.080 --> 09:58.310
Yukichi! Play with me!

09:58.310 --> 10:01.940
I'm bored! Yukichi!

10:02.330 --> 10:03.370
Boo!

10:06.720 --> 10:10.560
I... I'm sorry...

10:14.490 --> 10:16.050
<i>Green foxtail.</i>

10:29.520 --> 10:30.020
<i>Slap</i>

10:29.940 --> 10:30.440
<i>Slap</i>

10:30.270 --> 10:30.770
<i>Slap</i>

10:30.690 --> 10:31.190
<i>Slap</i>

10:31.020 --> 10:31.520
<i>Slap</i>

10:31.440 --> 10:31.940
<i>Slap</i>

10:31.770 --> 10:32.270
<i>Slap</i>

10:32.190 --> 10:32.690
<i>Slap</i>

10:32.520 --> 10:33.020
<i>Slap</i>

10:32.940 --> 10:33.440
<i>Slap</i>

10:33.270 --> 10:33.770
<i>Slap</i>

10:33.690 --> 10:33.900
<i>Slap</i>

10:39.930 --> 10:41.730
I'm home, Yukichi!

10:41.730 --> 10:43.660
I brought you a present!

10:43.660 --> 10:46.620
<b>Excited
Excited</b>

10:44.090 --> 10:45.660
Ta-dah!

10:45.080 --> 10:46.620
<b>Ba-dump
Ba-dump</b>

10:46.660 --> 10:48.910
<b>Slap Slap</b>

10:46.660 --> 10:48.910
<b>Pat Pat Pat</b>

10:47.620 --> 10:50.370
<b>Restless</b>

10:49.620 --> 10:50.370
<b>Slap</b>

10:50.370 --> 10:53.340
<b>Excited
Excited</b>

10:50.370 --> 10:53.340
<b>Ba-dump
Ba-dump</b>

10:50.680 --> 10:52.490
Come on! Come on!

11:06.950 --> 11:09.990
That wasn't what I was expecting at all!

11:12.010 --> 11:15.410
<i>Its scientific name is </i>Setaria viridis<i>.</i>

11:32.040 --> 11:34.920
Hello! White Cat Delivery Service!

11:37.020 --> 11:37.960
Are you Fukuzawa-san?

11:40.280 --> 11:42.960
Uh, Fukuzawa Saku-san?

11:43.610 --> 11:47.760
I have a delivery for her. May I get 
a signature or a hanko stamp?

11:48.140 --> 11:51.280
<i>Huh? A human? A human, right?</i>

11:51.280 --> 11:53.450
<i>A cat suit? To wear around the house?</i>

11:54.270 --> 11:56.020
Oh, thanks.

11:58.010 --> 12:00.030
Th-Thank you for your thoughtfulness.

12:04.350 --> 12:07.870
That scared me! Damn it, Senpai!

12:08.200 --> 12:10.870
He should have told me 
about someone like that.

12:11.220 --> 12:13.870
Should I make a report 
about it to the company?

12:21.760 --> 12:25.260
Well, I guess it doesn't matter as long 
as I don't have to redeliver the package.

12:34.350 --> 12:38.860
<i>Thank you very much 
for using our station today.</i>

12:40.010 --> 12:42.030
I'm home, Yukichi.

12:43.520 --> 12:46.410
What's this? From Mom?

12:46.940 --> 12:48.530
Really, a Mamazun delivery?

12:49.430 --> 12:51.540
Oh, there's a letter.

12:49.950 --> 12:51.540
<b>To Saku</b>

12:51.950 --> 12:55.500
<i>My dear stupid daughter, 
how is Yukichi-chan doing?</i>

12:56.050 --> 13:00.420
<i>Knowing your slovenly and desultory character, 
your father and I are worried about him.</i>

13:00.910 --> 13:03.420
As usual, she doesn't sugarcoat anything.

13:03.720 --> 13:06.930
<i>I have sent cat food to 
ease some of our worries.</i>

13:07.140 --> 13:10.930
<b>Packed...</b>

13:08.260 --> 13:11.470
<i>Please send pictures of Yukichi-chan 
to us every once in a while.</i>

13:11.470 --> 13:12.710
<i>Sincerely, your mother.</i>

13:13.720 --> 13:16.270
It's really all cat food.

13:18.770 --> 13:21.650
Yukichi! Can I take your picture?

13:25.580 --> 13:28.170
No! No! There's no need 
to make a peace sign!

13:28.850 --> 13:30.950
I want to send it to Mom!

13:31.370 --> 13:32.750
"He's doing great."

13:32.750 --> 13:34.540
That's all I sent as a text message.

13:35.550 --> 13:37.080
Whoa! That was fast!

13:38.150 --> 13:41.750
<i>Yukichi-chan's picture 
isn't included in your text?</i>

13:43.450 --> 13:48.220
Yukichi, can you act a little more like a cat?

13:48.830 --> 13:50.600
Like a normal cat!

13:52.040 --> 13:56.850
I haven't told my parents 
how big you've gotten!

13:56.850 --> 13:59.230
I'm begging you!

14:07.430 --> 14:08.850
Got it...

14:08.850 --> 14:12.490
Will you use some cat pictures 
I find as reference?

14:13.260 --> 14:14.260
Oh, yeah!

14:15.000 --> 14:18.470
Maybe taking your picture head on 
is making your size stand out!

14:20.760 --> 14:23.800
I should try taking a picture 
from high up or down low!

14:25.460 --> 14:26.810
<i>From above.</i>

14:28.970 --> 14:30.320
<i>From below.</i>

14:32.750 --> 14:35.670
<i>The room looks even smaller.</i>

14:36.690 --> 14:39.230
I'll just have to make a fake!

14:39.800 --> 14:42.440
<i>Brushing gloves meant for large dogs.</i>

14:42.770 --> 14:45.030
Yukichi! Lie down right there!

14:52.240 --> 14:53.940
Okay! Turn over!

15:10.800 --> 15:15.720
Just fur

15:10.970 --> 15:13.250
Look! Curled up and sleeping!

15:13.780 --> 15:15.010
It looks just like a cat.

15:17.610 --> 15:21.270
<i>That just looks like a black ball. 
Are you kidding me?</i>

15:23.360 --> 15:26.690
<i>How hard is it to send over 
a picture of your own cat?</i>

15:27.290 --> 15:29.180
<i>Are you really taking care of him?</i>

15:30.460 --> 15:33.650
This is bad! This is really bad!

15:35.870 --> 15:38.930
<i>Could it be that his home 
environment is really terrible?</i>

15:38.930 --> 15:40.790
Th-That's not true...

15:41.610 --> 15:43.600
M-Maybe it's not <i>not</i> true, but...

15:43.600 --> 15:46.980
"He improved his home environment 
by himself, and he's living well."

15:46.980 --> 15:49.510
I can't really tell her that...

15:50.260 --> 15:54.220
<i>I should go over and 
check on Yukichi-chan myself...</i>

15:53.090 --> 15:54.220
I knew it!

15:54.220 --> 15:56.550
She said something terrifying!

15:56.550 --> 15:57.750
What should I do?!

15:57.750 --> 15:59.150
What should I do, Yukichi?!

15:59.150 --> 16:00.900
Do something!

16:04.370 --> 16:06.850
I'm not talking about how to host her!

16:06.850 --> 16:10.040
Wait, why do you know 
Mom's alcohol preferences?!

16:11.160 --> 16:14.910
Goodness! What is taking her so long?

16:15.270 --> 16:20.370
I should really visit if she doesn't 
send me a proper photo this time.

16:21.410 --> 16:24.370
What in the world? You should have 
just sent this over from the start!

16:24.870 --> 16:26.170
Oh, how rare.

16:26.170 --> 16:27.380
A message from Saku?

16:27.740 --> 16:29.960
Yes! Quite rare!

16:29.960 --> 16:33.170
She hasn't sent a picture 
of herself in years!

16:33.170 --> 16:35.710
Oh! Send it to me, too!

16:35.710 --> 16:38.090
Goodness. That stupid girl.

16:38.090 --> 16:40.480
She never contacts us on her own!

16:40.480 --> 16:41.110
Oh, my.

16:41.110 --> 16:43.000
Jeez! Jeez! Jeez!

16:43.820 --> 16:46.190
<i>Goodness. She's not honest at all.</i>

16:48.010 --> 16:50.570
Looks like we placated her...

16:50.570 --> 16:53.190
Your plan was a complete success, Yukichi.

16:52.440 --> 16:54.700
Perspective

16:53.190 --> 16:54.700
As expected!

16:55.280 --> 17:00.150
I think she's mad that 
I haven't gone home in a while.

17:01.550 --> 17:02.250
Oh!

17:02.950 --> 17:06.330
We should take some more pictures like this!

17:06.690 --> 17:09.710
I need to have some prepared just 
in case she asks for more.

17:11.770 --> 17:14.510
I can show off pictures like this at work!

17:15.030 --> 17:17.720
"Isn't my cat super cute?"

17:20.040 --> 17:23.380
For now, though, I want a beer!

17:25.480 --> 17:28.130
<i>We had a huge photo shoot on a different day.</i>

17:29.820 --> 17:31.940
<i>The photo shoot on a different day.</i>

17:31.940 --> 17:34.820
Help me!

17:35.290 --> 17:36.950
This one is really good!

17:36.950 --> 17:42.080
A human who has completely forgotten
her original intention after playing
around with trick photos.

17:38.820 --> 17:42.080
A cat who got increasingly serious about
 photo angles and composition.

17:42.490 --> 17:44.870
<i>The train will be arriving soon.</i>

17:46.810 --> 17:49.130
I'm home, Yukichi!

17:54.760 --> 17:55.800
A message?

17:56.520 --> 17:58.260
From Mom?

17:58.260 --> 18:01.810
<i>I received something nice, 
so I sent it to you.</i>

18:02.350 --> 18:05.890
<i>I feel bad that I didn't send 
anything for Yukichi-chan.</i>

18:05.890 --> 18:07.600
<i>But you need to properly 
cook for yourself at home!</i>

18:08.260 --> 18:11.110
"Got it." Sent.

18:11.110 --> 18:15.310
Yukichi, did I get a package?

18:20.250 --> 18:22.270
He's super happy?!

18:24.190 --> 18:26.960
What? What'd we get?!

18:27.730 --> 18:30.330
Is this a stone plate?

18:30.330 --> 18:36.050
<b>High Quality Sharpening Stone</b>

18:30.760 --> 18:32.680
Oh, it's a sharpening stone.

18:32.680 --> 18:34.270
Like for knives.

18:34.270 --> 18:36.050
I've never seen one in person.

18:38.340 --> 18:39.430
All yours.

18:41.050 --> 18:44.060
Whoa! I-I-It's Mom!

18:44.490 --> 18:46.980
Y-Yes. Hello?

18:46.980 --> 18:50.200
<i>Sorry, were you in the middle of a date?</i>

18:51.020 --> 18:54.380
I was just looking at the package you sent!

18:56.320 --> 18:57.880
Thanks for the sharpening stone.

18:57.880 --> 19:02.030
Is Yukichi-chan disappointed 
because that's all I sent today?

19:02.400 --> 19:04.910
No, he's super happy about it.

19:04.910 --> 19:07.540
Huh? He's happy?

19:07.540 --> 19:09.840
No! The box! The cardboard box!

19:08.580 --> 19:11.920
<b>Squeeze</b>

19:09.840 --> 19:11.920
Don't normal cats love them?!

19:11.920 --> 19:13.650
What do you mean by <i>normal</i> cats?

19:13.650 --> 19:15.590
Are there abnormal cats out there?

19:15.590 --> 19:17.960
Definitely not!

19:17.960 --> 19:20.550
I want to see Yukichi-chan in a box, too!

19:20.550 --> 19:23.050
Huh?! That's impossible!

19:23.450 --> 19:24.620
<i>Why?!</i>

19:25.270 --> 19:26.450
I'm just tired!

19:26.450 --> 19:28.890
I have to work early tomorrow 
so I'm going to bed!

19:29.260 --> 19:31.440
Then at least let me hear him meow!

19:31.860 --> 19:33.270
Meow?!

19:42.450 --> 19:45.860
<i>I've never heard him meow myself!</i>

19:45.860 --> 19:48.450
<i>I've heard his weird laugh 
a few times, though.</i>

19:48.840 --> 19:51.990
He's the type that doesn't meow much.

19:51.990 --> 19:54.450
Oh, he's the perfect type 
for an apartment, then.

19:54.460 --> 19:56.460
<b>Purr</b>

19:56.460 --> 20:03.470
<b>Purr</b>

20:00.160 --> 20:02.890
<i>I satisfied her with his purring.</i>

20:04.300 --> 20:08.390
Yukichi, I'm going to take a bath.

20:09.650 --> 20:11.600
Oh! Are you going to start sharpening?!

20:12.060 --> 20:16.110
I didn't know you needed 
a sharpening stone at home, too.

20:16.530 --> 20:18.150
I thought only professionals used them.

20:18.150 --> 20:22.110
I end my workday by sharpening my knife.

20:22.710 --> 20:24.700
How did you get by until now?

20:31.900 --> 20:33.430
A teacup?

20:33.430 --> 20:35.950
Huh? You can sharpen a knife that way?!

20:37.510 --> 20:40.300
Amazing! What a life hack!

20:43.720 --> 20:47.060
Don't look at me like it's common sense!

20:47.060 --> 20:51.770
It's definitely not common 
sense for a cat, you know?!

20:57.830 --> 21:03.030
I would have bought him one 
if I knew it'd make him that happy.

21:03.800 --> 21:07.020
Yukichi, what's for dinner?

21:16.960 --> 21:20.080
Y-Yamanba?!

21:17.040 --> 21:23.460
<b>Hee Hee Hee</b>

21:27.040 --> 21:28.970
<i>Thank you, Mom.</i>

21:29.820 --> 21:33.460
<i>We're both enjoying the wonders 
of a sharpening stone.</i>

21:32.430 --> 21:34.560
<b>Deeply moved</b>

23:06.940 --> 23:32.260
<b>Next Episode</b>

23:07.380 --> 23:09.850
<i>I am a masterful cat.</i>

23:09.850 --> 23:11.840
<i>A masterful cat knows.</i>

23:12.360 --> 23:16.200
<i>There are DIY projects that you can do 
without asking a professional.</i>

23:16.200 --> 23:18.410
<i>DIY stands for "Do It Yourself."</i>

23:18.410 --> 23:20.960
<i>This term expressing self-reliance</i>

23:20.960 --> 23:25.800
<i>is said to have been coined in London 
at the end of World War II.</i>

23:26.430 --> 23:29.340
<i>If my human only tried to 
do more things herself...</i>

23:29.340 --> 23:30.860
<i>No, that'd be a problem.</i>

23:30.860 --> 23:34.660
<i>Next episode: "A Masterful Cat Is Able to DIY."</i>

23:32.260 --> 23:36.970
Can

23:32.260 --> 23:36.970
<b>A Masterful Cat Is Able to DIY</b>

23:34.660 --> 23:36.580
<i>Do it yourself.</i>
